    "collapsible_tabs_JVtXrV": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_j9XdX7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do SIHOO products come with a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every SIHOO chair sold by SIHOO Australia is covered by an Australian warranty serviced from our Sydney head office. Doro series chairs (Doro C300 Pro V2, C300 Pro, C500, C100, S300 and S100) come with a 5-year warranty. M series, V series and XALLKING gaming chairs come with a 3-year warranty. The warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship, and replacement parts are sent from the nearest warehouse. The exact term is shown on each product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WPAAPK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I claim a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>If you experience any issues with your SIHOO product, please contact our support team at <a>support@sihoo.com.au</a> or call 1300 002 580. Provide your proof of purchase and details about the issue, and we’ll guide you through the warranty process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_KwFjYc": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return my SIHOO chair if I’m not satisfied?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer a hassle-free return policy. If you’re not satisfied with your purchase, you can return the product within 30 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please note, a restocking fee may apply for certain returns. The item must be in its original packaging and condition. For more details, please refer to our return policy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_warranty_doro": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty on Doro chairs?",
            "answer": "<p>Five years. The Doro range – C300 Pro V2, C300 Pro, C500, C100, S300 and S100 – is covered for 5 years from the date of delivery, which is two years longer than our M and X series chairs. Keep your order confirmation as proof of purchase; no registration is needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_warranty_acl": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the warranty in addition to my Australian Consumer Law rights?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The SIHOO warranty is provided in addition to the consumer guarantees under the Australian Consumer Law, which cannot be excluded. If a product has a major failure you are entitled to a replacement or refund, and to compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
