      "blocks": {
        "question_cVq8Bg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the maximum weight limit?",
            "answer": "<p>Most SIHOO chairs – including the M18, M18 Pro, M57, M57 Pro, the XALLKING X5S and X5F, and the whole Doro range – are rated to 150 kg. Some models, including the V1, M56, M59, M76, M90, X5 Pro and X5C, are rated to 136 kg. Doro chairs use an SGS Class 4 gas lift. The exact rating is listed under Specifications on every product page and in the comparison table when you compare models.</p>"
